# "{5}, {T}, Exile The Echoverse Fulcrum: Destroy all creatures. Activate only as a sorcery." On turn 3 Bot1 has five untapped
# Moxen, but with its own Ornithopter spell on the stack the ability is not offered (CR 307.1, 602.5d); once the spell has
# resolved it is the positive control and is activated. Both Ornithopters (artifact creatures, Bot2's too) are destroyed
# together; the Fulcrum itself, exiled as a cost (CR 118.3), is in exile, and the five Moxen, noncreature artifacts, stay.

